OL,3,GNEWSASir Patrick Stewart 'used his
OL,4,Astage on behalf of others'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir Patrick Stewart, who has died at
OL,7,Fthe age of 86, has been described as a
OL,8,F"treasured" actor and a "true champion"
OL,9,Fof the Bristol theatre school he
OL,10,Ftrained at.
OL,12,FTributes have poured in since Sir
OL,13,FPatrick's death at his Los Angeles home
OL,14,Fon Wednesday after a "brief and
OL,15,Fpoignant journey" with Alzheimer's
OL,16,Fdisease and Lewy Body Dementia,
OL,17,Faccording to a statement shared on his
OL,18,Fsocial media.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
