OL,3,GNEWSASir Patrick Stewart 'used his
OL,4,Astage on behalf of others'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe acclaimed actor, who found global
OL,7,Ffame in Shakespeare productions, Star
OL,8,FTrek and X-Men, had trained at the
OL,9,FBristol Old Vic Theatre School from the
OL,10,Fage of 17.
OL,12,FHe was also a patron of local theatre
OL,13,Fcompany Unique Voice which tours
OL,14,Fschools, running drama workshops to
OL,15,Feducate children about domestic
OL,16,Fviolence.
